From: Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>
Subject: appxpackaging: package dependencies, resources and a bundle package's resources

IAppxManifestReader::GetPackageDependencies (PackageDependency: Name,
Publisher, MinVersion) and GetResources (Resource Language) were
E_NOTIMPL, and IAppxBundleManifestPackageInfo::GetResources did not read
a payload package's qualified resources (Language, Scale,
DXFeatureLevel). Deployment needs all three: frameworks a package depends
on, and which of a bundle's resource packages fit the user. The
interfaces' IIDs come from Microsoft's published win32metadata, via the
MIT-licensed windows crate.

